# 02 - Permissions (Linux)https://github.com/elifsudetopcu/linux-notes/tree/main

Linux permissions control who can **read**, **write**, or **execute** files and directories.

---

## Permission Types

| Symbol | Meaning  | Number |
|--------|----------|--------|
| r      | read     | 4      |
| w      | write    | 2      |
| x      | execute  | 1      |

---

## Permission Groups

| Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| u      | user (owner) |
| g      | group |
| o      | others |
| a      | all (u+g+o) |

---

## Checking Permissions

```bash
ls -l
